    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say it's not permanent, but that feels like something people just say to be nice. i've been dealing with this for so long and it just feels different this time. like the core of me is just... gone. it's like trying to repair a vase that's been ground into dust. you can't really \"fix\" dust, you know? it's just gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
